<title>MEXICO: Mexico TIIE 28-day rate rises to 26.20 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico TIIE 28-day rate rises to 26.20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate, known as the TIIE, rose to 26.20 percent on Thursday compared to Wednesday's rate of 25.945 percent, the Mexican Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9558</p>
</text>
